  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your field performance with Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical Action Shirt. Crafted from a breathable cotton/poly blend, this camo action shirt boasts a mock turtle neck style for comfort. Gusseted sleeves ensure unrestricted upper body motion, vital for peak performance. The anti-abrasion padded elbow patches provide added durability, while the zipper sleeve storage pockets offer convenient storage. Multiple hook and loop fields on the sleeves allow for personalized patches.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
